      "formula": "For each frozen Alpha158 model-support row, require finite nonnegative SUMP20 and SUMN20 and strictly positive finite CNTP20 and CNTN20. Set up_magnitude=SUMP20/CNTP20 and down_magnitude=SUMN20/CNTN20; require both finite and nonnegative and their sum strictly positive; then score=up_magnitude/(up_magnitude+down_magnitude). Add no epsilon, fill, clipping, winsorization, threshold, rank, sign or absolute-value transform.",
