        "source_expression_semantics": "Alpha158 SUMP20 and SUMN20 share the same total-absolute-close-change scale while CNTP20 and CNTN20 are matching sign frequencies. Dividing share by frequency is proportional to the conditional mean positive or negative one-session close-change magnitude; the final ratio cancels every common scale.",
